    <Folder>
      <name>Intelligence Summary</name>
      <Placemark>
        <name>AI Council Assessment</name>
        <styleUrl>#intel</styleUrl>
        <description>The Department of War is actively advancing its technological capabilities and personnel capabilities, with a focus on improving the recovery of critical materials and enhancing the security of classified defense work. The Department of War is also strengthening its partnerships with other nations in the Indo-Pacific region, including Peru, Fiji, Tonga, Australia, and New Zealand. The Department of War is also working closely with India to improve defense relations and cooperation in the Indo-Pacific region. The Department of War is also focusing on the protection of special operations forces from the invisible threat of blast exposure.</description>
        <Point>
          <coordinates>0,0,0</coordinates>
        </Point>
      </Placemark>
